Origin: upstream, https://github.com/NetworkManager/NetworkManager/commit/bcb96a1b19dae7306be0b373f0cf76660499ac61
Author: Mitchell Augustin <mitchell.augustin@canonical.com>
Description: Request a new password after an explicit SAE rejection.
 Retarget to Debian 1.52.1 without the unrelated PSK backport. Require an
 empty signal body and the active SAE setting before opening the existing agent.
 For legacy unspecified rejections, allow re-entry only after a failed
 association and explicit same-profile, same-AP selection by the same user.

